 not come to you with an example [i.e., argument] except that We bring you the truth and the best explanation.","j":19,"h":37,"s":25,"a":33,"sd":null},{"k":"25:34","t":"The ones who are gathered on their faces to Hell - those are the worst in position and farthest astray in [their] way.","j":19,"h":37,"s":25,"a":34,"sd":null},{"k":"25:35","t":"And We had certainly given Moses the Scripture and appointed with him his brother Aaron as an assistant.","j":19,"h":37,"s":25,"a":35,"sd":null},{"k":"25:36","t":"And We said, \"Go both of you to the people who have denied Our signs.\" Then We destroyed them with [complete] destruction.","j":19,"h":37,"s":25,"a":36,"sd":null},{"k":"25:37","t":"And the people of Noah - when they denied the messengers, We drowned them, and We made them for mankind a sign. And We have prepared for the wrongdoers a painful punishment.","j":19,"h":37,"s":25,"a":37,"sd":null},{"k":"25:38","t":"And [We destroyed] ʿAad and Thamūd and the companions of the well and many generations between them.","j":19,"h":37,"s":25,"a":38,"sd":null},{"k":"25:39","t":"And for each We presented examples [as warnings], and each We destroyed with [total] destruction.","j":19,"h":37,"s":25,"a":39,"sd":null},{"k":"25:40","t":"And they have already come upon the town which was showered with a rain of evil [i.e., stones]. So have they not seen it? But they are not expecting resurrection.","j":19,"h":37,"s":25,"a":40,"sd":null},{"k":"25:41","t":"And when they see you, [O Muḥammad], they take you not except in ridicule, [saying], \"Is this the one whom Allāh has sent as a messenger?","j":19,"h":37,"s":25,"a":41,"sd":null},{"k":"25:42","t":"He almost would have misled us from our gods had we not been steadfast in [worship of] them.\" But they are going to know, when they see the punishment, who is farthest astray in [his] way.","j":19,"h":37,"s":25,"a":42,"sd":null},{"k":"25:43","t":"Have you seen the one who takes as his god his own desire? Then would you be responsible for him?","j":19,"h":37,"s":25,"a":43,"sd":null}],"juz":19,"hizb":37,"surahs":[25],"sajdah":false}